# Build artifacts
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# FUSE leftovers from mounted-filesystem writes
.fuse_hidden*

# Never commit keys or credentials
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
ssh-agent*
eval*

# research pipeline dry-run artifacts
#
# Glob, not just the exact directory. The script rmSync's .dryrun-build at
# startup, which fails inside the agent sandbox (it cannot unlink under the
# mounted repo), so sessions have worked around it by renaming the old build
# aside — .dryrun-build-old-<ts>, -old2-, -old3-. Five of those accumulated
# untracked before anyone noticed. Same reason dryrun_out*.txt appear: piped
# run output nobody cleaned up.
.dryrun-build*
dryrun_out*.txt
